{
  "title": "每一句说话",
  "artist": "太极乐队",
  "duration": 261.407,
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "text": "曾遇挫折失败旁人不理我呼嗌",
      "start": 37.249,
      "end": 47.349,
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "全因你某天舒我愁怀我已深深了解",
      "start": 47.349,
      "end": 60.109,
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "但你忘情将爱活埋何解不理这心态",
      "start": 60.109,
      "end": 71.399,
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "还请紧记车厢中拥吻",
      "start": 71.399,
      "end": 76.13,
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "I Will Love You Till I Die",
      "start": 76.13,
      "end": 82.8,
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "无缘无份怎可分解痴心一片原是孽债",
      "start": 82.8,
      "end": 92.899,
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "悠悠长夜记起每句说话",
      "start": 92.899,
      "end": 98.57,
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "How I Love You My Darling",
      "start": 98.57,
      "end": 104.6,
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Hoe I Miss You",
      "start": 104.6,
      "end": 110.429,
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "宁愿永远失败来填补对你的债",
      "start": 110.429,
      "end": 121.3,
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "仍想起某天几段情怀",
